00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:08.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cherch m m m moyen d'atténuer

00:00:06.933 --> 00:00:09.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son anxiété liée

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à son diagnostic et

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la perspective de la mort.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.966 size:53% position:73% line:53%
En 2020, il a reçu une rare

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:14.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
exemption d'Ottawa lui

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:20.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tatatatant de suivre

00:00:13.066 --> 00:00:21.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
