00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.566 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Une avancée pour ce médecin,

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais il souligne que

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:56.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
